# ─── Test outputs (generated, never commit) ──────────────────────────────────
test-results/
tests/test-results/
tests/e2e/report/

# ─── Test outputs from MCP-driven browser sessions ───────────────────────────
# Accessibility dumps written by the Playwright MCP server. 56 of these were once
# committed; they are session scratch, never a deliverable.
.playwright-mcp/

# ─── Debug / scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The whole folder, not just debug/sample/. Probe and diagnostic output, ad-hoc
# screenshots, and one-off exports land here — generated, often large, and never
# reviewable. None of it belongs in a public repo.
debug/
health_test.json

# ─── Build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.tsbuildinfo

# ─── Editor and one-off backups ──────────────────────────────────────────────
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*~

# ─── Screenshots at the repository root ──────────────────────────────────────
# Documentation images belong under docs/. A PNG in the root is a leftover from
# a manual verification run — six of them once shipped to the public repo.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.gif
/*.webp

# ─── Local working notes (operator scratch, never published) ────────────────
# Italian analysis notes, drafts, and other local-only scratch documents live
# here. Gitignored on purpose: see "Local working notes" in
# docs/guides/PUBLIC_REPO_CHECKLIST.md.
/notes/

